        "Sulislaw"
      ],
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "The Zsiemsk-born lead designer of 'Wirrâl Untethered', a radiocomputer game made by the studio Fortress Accident.",
      "details": "His name is signed on a note left in a fridge, telling a colleague where to find the project's off-site copy. A project report blames him for last-minute additions, such as a secret mystical location at the very edge of the game's map.\n\nSoona, who worked on the same project, calls him the project lead and grumbles about his feature creep.",
