      "short": "Titus Hardie's brother, a family man with a window-fitting business who keeps out of the Hardie Boys' affairs.",
      "details": "Tibbs is short for Tiberius. Eugene says he has a wife, two kids and a third on the way, and has refused Titus's attempts to recruit him for years.",
      "spoiler": "Tibbs helped Fat Angus replace the broken window in Klaasje's room, part of the Hardie Boys' effort to cover up what really happened.",
