      "caseSensitive": true,
      "commonWord": true,
      "short": "The dockworkers' Union's forewoman before Evrart Claire. She stepped down after one term and vanished from public life.",
      "details": "Joyce Messier knows her only as 'Holly' from company correspondence. On the last day of the local elections, her daughter supposedly phoned to say she would not run again or ever come back to work. Joyce finds this suspicious, and Bird's Nest Roy remembers her as rather more pleasant than Evrart, wondering where she went.",
      "spoiler": "The Deserter despised her as a bourgeois deal-maker. He hints that, around twenty years ago, she was shot and fell into a canal on her way home, as part of a deal with Edgar Claire, and that the call from her 'daughter' was faked. He never quite admits to pulling the trigger himself.",
