        "yekokataa"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ulla-deponte",
      "term": "Ulla Deponte",
      "aliases": [
        "Deponte"
      ],
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A woman from a local legend and an old police case: in autumn '46 she was fishing by the water lock with Eva Delgado when Delgado vanished into the canal.",
      "details": "Idiot Doom Spiral tells it as a ghost story: a sudden downpour, a scream, and the silhouette of the Headless FALN Rider on the horizon. Eva slipped into the canal and her body was never found. Kim knows it as the Deponte-Delgado case from the case files.",
      "spoiler": "According to Kim, Deponte became the prime suspect, since the police theory was a love triangle and a fight on the jetty. She insisted the Headless FALN Rider was to blame, then killed herself before she could be taken into custody.",
      "seeAlso": [
        "union-of-moribund-alcoholics",
        "fishing-village",
        "kim-kitsuragi"
      ]
    },
