        "Isobel Sadie"
      ],
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "commonWord": true,
      "short": "An old, half-blind woman doing laundry in the Fishing Village; she knows everyone there and can rent you a room in her shack.",
      "details": "Her name is Isobel, Sadie by marriage. Born in Samara, she has cataracts but a sharp ear and a sharper tongue, hums an old Samaran lullaby while she works, and is proud of the cinderblock village its people built for themselves. She offers you the spare room in her shack for free, as a gesture of goodwill to the RCM.\n\nShe distrusts the Union and the Claire brothers, and hers is one of the two signatures Evrart Claire needs for his plans in the village.",
      "spoiler": "She had rented the same room to Ruby and is protective of her. If you find enough evidence in the shack, you can confront her about it.",
